                                                "sense_id": "884a106d-91fd-3d1f-98dd-062f1e69a152",
                                                "text": "Since ISI had been embraced by military juntas and urban interest-groups as an alternative to the oligarchic export-economy, government planners discriminated against exports by imposing heavy duties and pouring resources into manufacturing industry in preference to agriculture."
